\ S13 probe C1 — callee returns an App-typed output; poly caller cross-calls it.
\ Two prior attempts are recorded in the baseline: an empty body cannot declare
\ an App output (stack mismatch), and a member row over a bare value input
\ cannot dispatch ("has no input for a call to dispatch on"). This attempt:
\ the member takes the trait's head var BARE as its dispatch input (the shape
\ the dispatch error itself names), and mk forwards it.
import: intrinsics * ;

trait: Lift['F: * -> *]
  : up ( 'F -- 'F['T] ) ;
;

: mk ['F: Lift 'T] ( 'F -- 'F['T] ) up ;
: caller ['It 'T] ( 'T -- 'It['T] ) mk ;
: main ( -- ) ;
